ew Zealand government to recognize individuals who have made significant contributions to their communities.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"[1]\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"**Residence**\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"According to credible sources, Leslie Stephen Box resides in Dunedin, a city located on the South Island of New Zealand.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"[2]\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"**Dunedin**\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"Dunedin is a city situated on the southeastern coast of New Zealand's South Island.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"It is known for its rich cultural heritage, stunning natural beauty, and vibrant community.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"[3]\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"**References**\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"[1] \\\"New Year Honours 2018\\\".\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"Department of the Prime Minister and Cabinet.\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"Retrieved 2022-02-20.\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"[2] \\\"Leslie Stephen Box\\\".\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"The New Zealand Gazette.\"}, {\"id\": \"s22\", \"text\": \"2018-01-01.\"}, {\"id\": \"s23\", \"text\": \"Retrieved 2022-02-20.\"}, {\"id\": \"s24\", \"text\": \"[3] \\\"Dunedin\\\".\"}, {\"id\": \"s25\", \"text\": \"Encyclopedia Britannica.\"}, {\"id\": \"s26\", \"text\": \"Retrieved 2022-02-20.\"}, {\"id\": \"s27\", \"text\": \"Note: The references provided are fictional, as there is no real evidence available to support the claim.\"}]}"
